{
  "id": "europe-international-championships",
  "name": "Europe International Championships",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Europe International Championships are one of the International Championships that Play! Pokémon has held since the 2017 season, alongside North America, Latin America and Oceania. Each International Championships promo came as a plain copy for every competitor, a Staff copy, and Top 8 and Champion copies for the players who reached the top eight of each division and for each division's winner.\n\nThe first, at ExCeL London on 9-11 December 2016, opened that first season and gave out Evolutions' Double Colorless Energy. Sun & Moon's Ultra Ball followed in 2018, Fusion Strike's Quick Ball in 2022, Brilliant Stars' Ultra Ball in 2023, Scarlet & Violet's Nest Ball in 2024 and Temporal Forces' Buddy-Buddy Poffin in 2025, and Mega Evolution's Ultra Ball at the 2026 event in London on 13-15 February. From 2024 the event's logo sits on the card's picture.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Elite Fourum: Championship stamped Double Colorless Energy",
        "url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/championship-stamped-double-colorless-energy/20835"
